# scale: gitea, 5,500 files, at the README's 132x41. First the timed steps: merl starting in the
# repository, d, u and s there, each the fastest of three runs. Then the README's own demo.steps
# plays to the end, so a change that breaks a README recording shows here before the next
# recording does; its review.steps plays in polar, in readme-review.
project gitea
size 132x41
merl
time
wait Open a file
key o
type user block
key Down Enter
wait services/user/block.go
key /
type IsOw
key Enter
time
key d
wait via org_model
key [
wait services/user/block.go
time
key u
wait Usages of
key Escape s
type QueueSettings{}
time
wait queue.go:49
include assets/demo.steps
